  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WILPF - WPS - Nigeria 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WILPFs country programme in Nigeria - Strengtheing the capacities of grassroot women as peacebuilders.

Women&apos;s International Leage for Peace and Freedom in Nigeria builds the capacity of women peacebuilders in Nigeria to mobilize for peace and to respond to conflict both at formal and informal levels.</narrative>
  </description>
